{"title":"合作发展","lang":"cn","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"发展合作","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"在比什凯克国立大学与外国科研教育机构签订的合作协议框架内，开展各种形式的学术交流，其中包括学生和教师交流、语言课程和科研实习、联合研究项目以及其他形式的国际学术交流。","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"每年，在比什凯克国立大学学习的外国学生、研究生和实习生的数量都在不断增长，我校师生出国进行教育和研究的人数也在不断增加。","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"在与外国合作伙伴准备新的合作协议时，请使用已批准的 大学制定的模板合同。","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"BSU 地图","links":[{"label":"BSU 地图","href":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bkwOgULGB-CX-HuzOgx_4LuSe4nii4HW/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=116706934680820971102&rtpof=true&sd=true"}]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"协议","links":[{"label":"协议","href":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pR_NaPS9535Cma5YE4ACn7e5PNOJg6E_/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=116706934680820971102&rtpof=true&sd=true"}]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"备忘录","links":[{"label":"备忘录","href":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1UoSQCZcE1Jrqp9hX1B1gaYbNf2SULp-d/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=116706934680820971102&rtpof=true&sd=true"}]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"合同","links":[{"label":"合同","href":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ACEGNL27W9xyPPc-EyOtUqRVUuT97IUJ/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=116706934680820971102&rtpof=true&sd=true"}]}],"variants":[{"id":"4947f76776d6","lang":"ru","title":"Развитие сотрудничества"},{"id":"4947f76776d6-ky-e55c0","lang":"ky","title":"Развитие сотрудничества"},{"id":"4947f76776d6-en-ba7ad","lang":"en","title":"Development of cooperation"},{"id":"4947f76776d6-cn-c174a","lang":"cn","title":"合作发展"}]}
